6438798}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "15f88305-1592-5719-98bf-9e054cd03fe2" :question/math-academy-id "q-108667" :question/problem "![](images/81/811ead4928d2f245235736dce473d121261ea358ca4ff3a0cc8b01bb2e9f3b31.png)\n\nOn which of the following intervals is the function $f(x)$ (shown above) invertible?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x\\in (-3,3)$\n- **II.** $x\\in [1,4]$\n- **III.** $x\\in (-\\infty ,-3]$" :question/worked-solution "A function is invertible on a particular interval if and only if it's a one-to-one function on that interval. To determine the intervals on which the function is invertible, we use the horizontal line test.\n\n- The given function is invertible on the interval $x\\in (-\\infty ,-3].$ Indeed, any horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n![](images/32/32f1ad5bdec30951900a1c30c2996ea040e65880f859c43769faf374db06a2f0.png)\n\n- The given function is **not** invertible on the intervals $x\\in (-3,3)$ and $x\\in [1,4]$ because some horizontal lines will intersect the curve more than once.\n\n![](images/8e/8ed451b24fa83de513f4a1b5c79d39f94add784c6b7265e765a3381e7b03363a.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244151 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124473 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ffd143c8-a993-5d0b-85a5-821d6482ae60" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Intervals on Which a Function is Invertible Given Its Graph" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049731 :topic/id #uuid "0f127f4a-3cf5-5736-90b8-9817b73eb050" :topic/math-academy-id 1889 :topic/title "Invertible Functions"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "525e1ea4-6bb3-5a33-a72b-5ca54229e233" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437540} {:answer/id #uuid "5b4ec695-175b-5f77-9f49-01c0df93d480" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437541}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b4ec695-175b-5f77-9f49-01c0df93d480" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437541} :answer-field/id #uuid "8c32b0be-f2c4-536c-a1eb-36fc12e4aebd" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438799} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9fb25303-ab56-5cdd-bee9-c1f33b59061a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437542} {:answer/id #uuid "ff43e512-ac4e-56ca-a5ad-fea896204c19" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437543}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9fb25303-ab56-5cdd-bee9-c1f33b59061a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437542} :answer-field/id #uuid "adc31504-ebca-597a-a993-cdf2c6e69be4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438800} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "96691431-68ee-56fb-967b-b1ff482e5a59" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437544} {:answer/id #uuid "7d673f77-1cab-58bc-b439-aa3fac5d152a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437545}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d673f77-1cab-58bc-b439-aa3fac5d152a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437545} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e437179-705a-505d-a1b3-49271e197fe6" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438801}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "35a0e892-6583-50a3-a3c1-b86c3920f28b" :question/math-academy-id "q-108673" :question/problem "![](images/3d/3db32ea943ff1f457704a29f325a592eb4e1e0e53ee258041d08346bf9da4716.png)\n\nOn which of the following intervals is the function $f(x)$ (shown above) invertible?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x\\in (-2,0]$\n- **II.** $x\\in (-3,0)$\n- **III.** $x\\in (0,2)$" :question/worked-solution "A function is invertible on a particular interval if and only if it's a one-to-one function on that interval. To determine the intervals on which the function is invertible, we use the horizontal line test. \n\n- The given function is invertible on the intervals $x\\in (-2,0]$ and $x\\in (0,2).$ Indeed, any horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n![](images/46/46e1daf2cb9025b6a736f223fbe168ea32b66302cebea23ca3a2d473e78b77b3.png)\n\n        \n\n- The given function is **not** invertible on the interval $(-3,0)$  because some horizontal lines will intersect the curve more than once.\n\n![](images/d2/d2ed3670f7c67d60c7739ee35d66943b8341b2a49faa97546242609dd39afabc.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244191 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049007 :topic/id #uuid "d2f7b6dc-5c4f-5fe0-a707-ef07a4daca20" :topic/math-academy-id 2522 :topic/title "Bernoulli Differential Equations"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bb9d536d-0e0e-56d0-b075-65f0dfbd2a4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461497} {:answer/id #uuid "508f9c1d-ff37-59ea-8879-8c3b43a99d9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461498}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "508f9c1d-ff37-59ea-8879-8c3b43a99d9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461498} :answer-field/id #uuid "d05f7a7f-f105-54d3-b92a-8e85aaa18df5" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462502} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10df3356-aa72-55c4-bcd3-8b55d0e35022" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461499} {:answer/id #uuid "ae3cf18f-98e0-5531-8398-e40d7d3f3583" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461500}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae3cf18f-98e0-5531-8398-e40d7d3f3583" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461500} :answer-field/id #uuid "12a30126-3bf0-5ebf-853d-b9c28b6450dc" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462503} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70c6c33b-acc0-53d0-83fb-1320d1026d19" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461501} {:answer/id #uuid "55465f4e-feef-55e7-aee1-cf9db4d48e96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461502}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "70c6c33b-acc0-53d0-83fb-1320d1026d19" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461501} :answer-field/id #uuid "a96caab2-f5ca-53aa-b65f-98a419247edb" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462504}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f464429f-4905-5c37-b6cf-d2ce0cb09dd7" :question/math-academy-id "q-108911" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}-\\sqrt{x}\\,y=\\frac{{x}^{3}}{y}$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}+y\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=-\\sqrt{x{y}^{3}}$ $$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}-{y}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x={y}^{6}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+p(x)y=q(x){y}^{n},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is a real number.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Equation I is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=-\\sqrt{x},\\,q(x)={x}^{3},\\,n=-1.\n$$\n\n- Equation II is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x,\\,q(x)=-\\sqrt{x},\\,n=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\n- Equation III is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244192 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049007 :topic/id #uuid "d2f7b6dc-5c4f-5fe0-a707-ef07a4daca20" :topic/math-academy-id 2522 :topic/title "Bernoulli Differential Equations"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a2b16ff-480b-5920-a02a-3a1113084ec6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461503} {:answer/id #uuid "bb654b6e-18b2-515f-a240-33d5be06024d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461504}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1a2b16ff-480b-5920-a02a-3a1113084ec6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461503} :answer-field/id #uuid "0248c736-0f29-5188-901a-4d4aa3e4ae2c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462505} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bac7a93d-d937-5618-80f7-910f2907cb9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461505} {:answer/id #uuid "6e24f40f-1611-5210-9da6-6cf12584dfe2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461506}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e24f40f-1611-5210-9da6-6cf12584dfe2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461506} :answer-field/id #uuid "69ef8d6f-1e8a-5807-9ad5-6be9ec18aef6" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462506} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "399fd328-0dff-5b83-ad3e-6eadc53264ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461507} {:answer/id #uuid "f13ba9c6-fd30-5e83-986a-34fb441fe34e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461508}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "399fd328-0dff-5b83-ad3e-6eadc53264ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461507} :answer-field/id #uuid "c969fdd5-7a1f-5912-a7b8-46f92b36dfbd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462507}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "bc73c612-2a32-5b85-8989-8b463754a48c" :question/math-academy-id "q-108913" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}+{x}^{-2}{y}^{3}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡y$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}-{e}^{x}y={x}^{2}{y}^{5}$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}+{y}^{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x=-x{y}^{3}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+p(x)y=q(x){y}^{n},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is a real number.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Equation I is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing both the $p(x)y$ and $q(x){y}^{n}$ terms.\n\n- Equation II is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=-{e}^{x},\\,q(x)={x}^{2},\\,n=5.\n$$\n\n- Equation III is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244193 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049007 :topic/id #uuid "d2f7b6dc-5c4f-5fe0-a707-ef07a4daca20" :topic/math-academy-id 2522 :topic/title "Bernoulli Differential Equations"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4188ff28-f5eb-597b-bef2-216186195b37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759