ef 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461514} :answer-field/id #uuid "072f6e88-7786-51e0-b297-e5c7e6409e73" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462510}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e63ce1e7-0f23-5c8c-a5ed-4ae3fc1a265b" :question/math-academy-id "q-108914" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}+\\sqrt{x}y={x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}+{x}^{2}{y}^{2}=x{y}^{3}$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+p(x)y=q(x){y}^{n},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is a real number.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Equation I is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $q(x){y}^{n}$ terms.\n\n- Equation II is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\n- Equation III is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)={x}^{2},\\,q(x)=\\sqrt{x},\\,n=-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244194 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049007 :topic/id #uuid "d2f7b6dc-5c4f-5fe0-a707-ef07a4daca20" :topic/math-academy-id 2522 :topic/title "Bernoulli Differential Equations"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75270618-7af7-5381-9066-6d3469656acb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461515} {:answer/id #uuid "67390882-204b-5352-ad1e-ccec65f496a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461516}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75270618-7af7-5381-9066-6d3469656acb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461515} :answer-field/id #uuid "b208e569-82a8-5d09-9cd4-e626e88672d8" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462511} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04b1fb51-971c-5aa9-804d-0ccdfcc7a696" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461517} {:answer/id #uuid "c7880ef3-333f-5868-b08a-8422f8cfd792" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461518}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04b1fb51-971c-5aa9-804d-0ccdfcc7a696" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461517} :answer-field/id #uuid "917fdd71-e52e-5156-b297-f58247d19d0f" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462512} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5587940f-b2d2-50f4-8efe-1abc1acf4aab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461519} {:answer/id #uuid "41170317-0947-57dc-838f-57dc269df7a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461520}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5587940f-b2d2-50f4-8efe-1abc1acf4aab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461519} :answer-field/id #uuid "03ac02f9-35ab-51dd-af88-ea5627438f45" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462513}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c444e682-8c21-501d-82e3-dbe63de4e200" :question/math-academy-id "q-108916" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n- **I.** ${y}^{2}{y}^{′}-x{y}^{5}={y}^{4}$\n- **II.** $y{y}^{′}-x\\sqrt{y}={x}^{2}$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}+y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x=x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+p(x)y=q(x){y}^{n},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is a real number.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Equation I is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. If we attempt to write the equation in standard form, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-x{y}^{3}={y}^{2}\n$$\n\nand this is not a Bernoulli differential equation because it is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\n- Equation I is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. If we attempt to write the equation in standard form, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{y}}=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{y}\n$$\n\nand this is not a Bernoulli differential equation because it is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\n- Equation III is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $q(x){y}^{n}$ term.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the given equations is a Bernoulli differential equation.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244195 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049007 :topic/id 